#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:252
#, no-c-format
msgid "Requirements"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:254
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To use &kmobiletools; you need to properly configure your distribution, try "
"reading documentation in your distribution first. &kmobiletools; needs that "
"you already have the devices created in /dev (manually or with udev), and "
"that you have read/write permissions. You should also ensure that your "
"mobile phone is properly configured."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:262
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can find a list of changes at <ulink url=\"http://www.kmobiletools."
"org\">http://www.kmobiletools.org</ulink>."
msgstr ""

